3	/**
4	 * Derives an owner's {@code identityKey}, the single value all duplicate detection is
5	 * expressed through and which is also exposed on the owner response.
6	 *
7	 * <p>The key is the lower-case hex SHA-256 digest over
8	 * {@code normalizedTelephone + '|' + lowerEmail + '|' + soundex(lastName)}. By the time an
9	 * owner is built its telephone has been normalized to E.164 and its email lower-cased, so
10	 * those stored values are the normalized forms; a null email contributes an empty segment.
11	 * The last-name segment is its {@link Soundex} code (never null).
12	 *
